                "loc": "LUK.24.44+LUK.24.45+LUK.24.46+LUK.24.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 24:44-47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mani aza koza engapi Mungu vuri isule rarisi, ma pa so ani ecazu kpere andru ’do, e’yo mani ma eti nzezu ’ba were ’diyi dri azini ’ba ambo ’diyi dri indi, Ma ’yoni e’yo aluni ku pe e’yo nde nabi pini ndra ’yole Musa be, eri nga eca rari: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
